WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 2.9 · Theory of Change
Test, write and use your Theory of Change

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A Theory of Change is useful only when people test it and use it.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Write a plain one-page narrative for each pathway.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Test it with participants, partners and a sceptic.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Version it, date it and set a review.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Version 2.0, approved by the general meeting. Next review at the annual meeting, or sooner if a large grant is offered.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your testing plan, narrative and review plan.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
